cff-version: 1.2.0
title: DermWorkup-Offline analysis code and audit results
message: >-
  Code and aggregate audit outputs supporting the reconstruction and ranking audit of
  sequential pigmented-lesion records from public longitudinal 3D total-body
  photography. The accompanying manuscript is under review.
